# Jai Shree Ram # Om namah shivay!

# NEW BARREL SYSTEM - Structure load based
# Special barrel ek hi hota hai per level ({level}-sb)
# rand_chest reuse karke barrel variant decide hota hai (sirf 1 sb per level hai, toh seedha load)

# Level 1 special barrel (Block_Count=154)
execute at @e[type=minecraft:armor_stand,tag=OneBlockAnchor,scores={Block_Count=154}] run structure load 1-sb 0 50 0
execute at @e[type=minecraft:armor_stand,tag=OneBlockAnchor,scores={Block_Count=154}] run playsound mob.vindicator.celebrate @a 0.33 51.00 0.47 20 1

